+## Overview
+
+Across 30 orders, total revenue reached $7,154.44. The median order value was $204.94, indicating a wide spread between small and large orders.
+
+## Top Products
+
+Gadget leads all products with $2,392.00 in total revenue, about one third of the business. Widget follows at $2,118.94, Doohickey at $1,513.00, and Sprocket trails at $1,130.50.
+
+## Regional Performance
+
+North is the strongest region at $2,176.35. East earned $1,830.79, South $1,732.48, and West is the weakest at $1,414.82.
+
+## Recommendations
+
+- Promote Gadget in West, where overall revenue lags other regions.
+- Review Sprocket pricing or bundle offers, since it earns the least revenue.
+- Investigate why West underperforms and test targeted campaigns there.
